OL,3,GNEWSARescue centres see rise in
OL,4,Amalnourished hedgehogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescue centres say they are dealing
OL,7,Fwith a large increase in malnourished
OL,8,Fhedgehogs, with more expected over the
OL,9,Fwinter.
OL,11,FThe summer heat and drought made it
OL,12,Fvery hard for the animals to find their
OL,13,Fnatural prey such as slugs and
OL,14,Fearthworms, with young hoglets
OL,15,Fparticularly vulnerable.
OL,17,FHedgehog Rescue in Chipping Sodbury,
OL,18,Fnear Bristol is looking for more
OL,19,Fvolunteers and donations to help the
OL,20,Fhedgehogs it rescues across South
OL,21,FGloucestershire, Bristol and Bath.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
