OL,3,GNEWSARescue centres see rise in
OL,4,Amalnourished hedgehogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTracey Boden, who runs the centre,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We are seeing so many baby
OL,8,Fhedgehogs that are so thin, dehydrated
OL,9,Fand malnourished. I have been running
OL,10,Fthe centre for 13 years and I have
OL,11,Fnever seen it so bad."
